    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Tiers API provides access to the different loyalty points tiers available within the hotel loyalty program. This endpoint allows consumers to retrieve a comprehensive list of tiers, which can be used to understand the rewards structure for customers. Typical users include application developers and partners who integrate loyalty functionalities into their platforms, enhancing customer engagement and experience. By leveraging this API, businesses can better inform their customers about loyalty options and drive participation in their loyalty programs.",
